/apps/mobile-wallet-pwa/*  /apps/mobile-wallet/  301
/apps/mobile-wallet-pwa    /apps/mobile-wallet/  301

# The Windows .msi was WITHDRAWN (2026-07-18): it was built from a partial branch
# and its Swap pane badges itself "live" over an L2 that does not exist. It cannot
# be rebuilt next to the macOS one — Tauri does not cross-bundle and no Windows CI
# runner is provisioned. Without this rule the path falls through to the SPA
# fallback and answers 200 with HTML for a URL ending in .msi; send people to the
# downloads page, which explains the withdrawal and points at building from source.
/Postern-Desktop-Windows-x64.msi  /downloads.html  302
/dl/Postern-Desktop-Windows-x64.msi  /downloads.html  302

